    "text": "WSYX ABC6\nwebsite\nOhio\nFormer Dayton Mayor Nan Whaley endorses Dr. Amy Acton for Ohio governor\nBy WSYX Staff,\n11 hours agoCOLUMBUS, Ohio (WSYX) — Dr. Amy Action has picked up another endorsement in her run for Ohio Governor. Former Dayton Mayor Nan Whaley, a former gubernatorial nominee herself, is backing Acton. I know firsthand the challenges facing Ohio—and that’s why I am proud to endorse Dr. Amy Acton for...\n467",
